    std_suite_failures_are_unbuilt_features_2026-09-20, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep-20261127: re-ran the std suite on fresh HEAD seed (baseline 943 specs, 933 passed, 10 file-failures). Per item: spipe_before_all_after_all 3/3 PASS (landed), spipe_alias export 3/3 (landed), no_paren_test passes by direct run (dir sweep does not pick up *_test.spl - runner quirk noted), mock_phase6 59/59 (landed), treesitter facade renamed + 8/8 (landed). Implemented/fixed: new src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/spec/mock.spl (pure-Simple text-valued Mock/Spy/Stub/CallRecorder/CallVerifier under std.spec.mock - the seed's bundled module is Any-valued which does not exist in the pure tree, so this is a text-valued equivalent per builder.spl conventions; std.spec.mock now resolves into src/lib under SIMPLE_LIB=src); mock_simple_spec imports from std.spec.mock (1/1); mock_phase5 gained MockFunction.new delegating to create (28/28 - spec drift); feature_validation/codegen_spec canary oracle closed with SIMPLE_JIT_STRICT=1 measured evidence (33/33 - the F64 dict-miss divergence it pinned is fixed). New regression spec test/01_unit/std/mock_framework_spec.spl 8/8. Final sweep: 944 specs 937 passed 7 file-failures. Remains: perf_optimization_spec (undeclared rt_thread_spawn_isolated2 extern - seed runtime exports only isolated_with_args; plus the documented race-pin) - P2 owned by the threads lane per the doc. Side effects (pre-existing collisions resolved by the new module): std mock_spec 4/4 (was compile-error), lib/common mock_spec 20/41 (was 0; the rest needs the full policy/ArgMatcher surface - deliberately not half-built). Residual pre-existing failures documented in build/p3cache/stdsuite/RESULTS.md (context_spec facade drift, testing_framework parse error line 508, module_import fixture parse, 3 process-quoting specs). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/std/mock_framework_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/std/mock_phase5_spec.spl"

